illuminates the question of uploading, but I haven't sorted it out
in my mind yet.  In any case I plan to get the book recomended in this
forum earlier and continue these experiments.  At least I now finally
know that I do, indeed, dream in color.  A question I've always wondered
about but never been able to answer until I noticed it while dreaming
conciously, and remembered that.

